{"availability":"available","full":"vndee/llm-sandbox","name":"llm-sandbox","description":"Lightweight and portable LLM sandbox runtime (code interpreter) Python library.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1130,"forks":107,"created":"2024-06-27T03:58:23Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:37:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vndee.github.io/llm-sandbox/","topics":["code-generation","code-interpreter","large-language-models","llm-sandbox"],"demo":"https://vndee.github.io/llm-sandbox/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T04:06:28.817Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T04:06:28.817Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T04:06:28.817Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:36:28.099Z","stars":1129,"forks":107},{"at":"2026-10-12T04:06:28.817Z","stars":1130,"forks":107}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Securely Execute LLM-Generated Code with Ease","LLM Sandbox is a lightweight and portable sandbox environment designed to run Large Language Model (LLM) generated code in a safe and isolated mode. It provides a secure execution environment for AI-generated code while offering flexibility in container backends and comprehensive language support, simplifying the process of running code generated by LLMs.","✨ New: This project now supports the Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, which allows your MCP clients (e.g. Claude Desktop) to run code generated by LLMs in a secure sandbox environment."],"features":["Isolated Execution: Code runs in isolated containers with no access to host system","Security Policies: Define custom security policies to control code execution","Resource Limits: Set CPU, memory, and execution time limits","Network Isolation: Control network access for sandboxed code","Docker: Most popular and widely supported option"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vndee/llm-sandbox/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ef6d84631b42b31d7a5cb1a9c554fef237a2fb57e735b8ca8cf03a47294a